          "published_at": "2026-11-11T07:47:09.654000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/HamelHusain/status/2120423068128727247",
          "topic": "Benchmark uncertainty and reproducibility",
          "text": "Love to see error bars on benchmarks \n\nIt’s very much a chart crime not to show them",
          "quote_tweet": {
            "url": "https://x.com/ryan_marten/status/2119845004940378276",
            "published_at": "2026-11-09T17:30:08.650000Z",
            "author": {
              "name": "Ryan Marten",
              "handle": "ryan_marten"
            },
            "text": "Terminal-Bench 4.1 is here with updated verifiers for all tasks.\n\nIn this release, we focused on:\n- resisting reward hacking\n- reducing false negatives\n- improving reproducibility\n\nRe-grading the 4.0 leaderboard trials with the 4.1 verifiers, resulted in ~1% of rewards flipping."
          },
          "author_replies": [],
          "render_audit": {
